<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's STB reports first half profit.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's STB reports first half profit.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Tunisienne de Banques, the second largest bank in Tunisia, made interim profit of 7.88 million in the first half of 1996, results showed on Saturday.</p>
<p>Figures for the same period last year were not available. STB posted a 15.62 million dinars net profits during the whole of 1995.</p>
<p>The state-controlled bank has a capital of 80 million dinars and is listed on the Tunis Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>($1=0.97 dinar)</p>
</text>
